== mail
- Six weeks aboard tomorrow. Tea's on me again, bow lounge, {time}. Bring your questions. And biscuits, if you've got any.

== ask
- Six weeks! Tea with Zeke after shift, bow lounge.
- Six weeks aboard. You know where everything is now. Nearly everything.   #funny

== here
- Six weeks. Someone asked you the way yesterday. I saw.   #funny
- To six weeks. Remember your first board? Look at you now.   #warm
- Your turn. Tell me one thing about the Wren I don't know. Go on.

== thanks
- You share a tea with Zeke in the bow lounge. Six weeks ago you didn't know where the lift was.   #warm

== chatter
- The new hand's six weeks aboard. Zeke's still buying the tea.   #funny
- Six weeks for the new hand already. Where does it go?
